     "@en": "**Sağa dönün** = turn right; **sola dönün** = turn left."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**Düz gidin** indica que continúes recto. Las terminaciones **-in/-ın** hacen la instrucción más cortés.",
     "@en": "**Düz gidin** indicates that you continue straight. **-in/-ın** endings make the instruction more courteous."
    }
   ]
  },
